WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.530
Southwark, a London borough, 2022.

2
00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:08.090
In the council elections, borough
turnout was 34.0 per cent.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:14.410
In Dulwich Village, 60.7 per cent voted:
the highest of any ward in London.

4
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.730
In Peckham, in the same
borough, just 25.8 per cent.

5
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.250
Same council, same election.

6
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.130
So why do some people engage so much less?

7
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.330
Do they not care?

8
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.030
Have they no time?

9
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.110
In this mission, you'll
measure engagement:

10
00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.970
turnout, civic action, and
support for community groups.

11
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.250
Then you'll follow community groups through
the regeneration of Southwark's estates,

12
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.230
where priorities clash.

13
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:43.960
Your mission: explain why some people
engage less with the place where they live.
